# Build context for airgap/Dockerfile. The image only needs source: module
# files, Go code and vendored WIT. Everything below is either large, generated,
# or would bake stale artifacts into the toolchain image.
.git
.github
docs
bench-output

# Build outputs from local `wash build` runs.
**/build/
**/*.wasm
**/gen/

# Scratch notes that are not part of the repo.
*.md
!README.md
!BUILDING.md
